  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition 6 of planning permission 23/02175/FUL of which reads:\r\rThe development hereby permitted shall incorporate security measures to minimise the risk of crime and to meet the specific security needs of the development in accordance with the principles and objectives of Secured by Design. Details of these measures shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the local planning authority prior to commencement of the development and shall be implemented in accordance with the approved details prior to occupation.\r\rReason: In order to achieve the principles and objectives of Secured by Design to improve community safety and crime prevention in accordance with Policy CS 14 of Kingston Core Strategy: Safer Communities, Policy DM 22 Design for Safety and Policy SD6 of the London Plan (2021).\r\rIs replaced with:\r\rThe development hereby permitted shall incorporate security measures to minimise the risk  of crime and to meet the specific security needs of the development in accordance with the principles and objectives of Secured by Design. Details of these measures shall be submitted to an approved in writing by the local planning authority prior to commencement of above ground works (excluding demolition) and the development shall be implemented in accordance with the approved details prior to occupation.\r\rReason: In order to achieve the principles and objectives of Secured by Design to improve community safety and crime prevention in accordance with Policies CS15 and DM22 of Kingston's Core Strategy 2012 and Policy SD6 of the London Plan 2021."
  ],
